<title>USA: TABLE-Zydeco Energy Inc Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Zydeco Energy Inc Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.26     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,701     loss	   203</p>
<p> Revs			   257			353</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,605		    5,810</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.34		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,267			593</p>
<p> Revs			   631			605</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,600		    5,805</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said the increase in net loss for the second quarter of 1997 was primarily due to the accelerated level of geophysical expenses of $995,000, or $0.15 per share, as the company completed its seismic data acquisition phase for its West Cameron Seismic Project.</p>
